---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Project history">
  <Hero><span>Project history</span></Hero>
  <article class="col-span-full bg-background-primary p-[var(--grid-display-size)] shadow-border body-text body-text--constrain-width" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2>2026-10-15 — Initial higher-education inventory</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Replaced the private Airtable loaders with version-controlled JSON and Astro schema validation.</li>
      <li>Separated canonical concepts, university design systems, source implementations, and research evidence.</li>
      <li>Added Card, Hero, Accordion, Navigation, and Image + Text research from Ohio State, Yale, Illinois, and Maryland.</li>
      <li>Added implementation detail pages and cross-system comparison tables for exact source API declarations.</li>
      <li>Recorded variants, named presets, states, responsive behavior, conditions, and composition constraints independently.</li>
      <li>Retained search, browsing, sorting, and filtering, with no public deployment configured.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Upstream history</h2>
    <p>This project is adapted from <a href="https://github.com/inbn/component-gallery">The Component Gallery</a>. Consult the upstream repository for its original history.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
